    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987990/extras/83dc9e3ef00b395d67a042fff3b59aa2.poster.avif?t=1755200953\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987990/extras/83dc9e3ef00b395d67a042fff3b59aa2.webm?t=1755200953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987990/extras/83dc9e3ef00b395d67a042fff3b59aa2.mp4?t=1755200953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Grass-cutting game about a frog</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's hidden beneath the grass? Ropuka is a frog, living in a small cottage house surrounded by endless fields and meadows. Cut down the grass, collect new tools and items while exploring beautiful, hand-crafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987990/extras/7c3df400a11c2b0d53fae613efdd93bf.poster.avif?t=1755200953\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987990/extras/7c3df400a11c2b0d53fae613efdd93bf.webm?t=1755200953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987990/extras/7c3df400a11c2b0d53fae613efdd93bf.mp4?t=1755200953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a frog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut grass. A lot of grass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore meadows, forests, and fields filled with secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tools and upgrade your abilities to reach previously unreachable places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover mysteries behind Ropuka's world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987990/extras/83dc9e3ef00b395d67a042fff3b59aa2.poster.avif?t=1755200953\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987990/extras/83dc9e3ef00b395d67a042fff3b59aa2.webm?t=1755200953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987990/extras/83dc9e3ef00b395d67a042fff3b59aa2.mp4?t=1755200953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Grass-cutting game about a frog</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's hidden beneath the grass? Ropuka is a frog, living in a small cottage house surrounded by endless fields and meadows. Cut down the grass, collect new tools and items while exploring beautiful, hand-crafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987990/extras/7c3df400a11c2b0d53fae613efdd93bf.poster.avif?t=1755200953\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987990/extras/7c3df400a11c2b0d53fae613efdd93bf.webm?t=1755200953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987990/extras/7c3df400a11c2b0d53fae613efdd93bf.mp4?t=1755200953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a frog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut grass. A lot of grass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore meadows, forests, and fields filled with secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tools and upgrade your abilities to reach previously unreachable places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover mysteries behind Ropuka's world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
